    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d597">

                <pb facs="0635" n="547" xml:id="pg547"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">721.23/1915: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Acting Secretary of State to the Ambassador in
                        Peru</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic">Dearing</hi>)</head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1933-07-26T13:00:00-04:00">July 26, 1933—1 p.m.</date></dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>75. Your 176, July 25, 11 a.m. You may transmit message. Make it clear that
                    Colombian suggestion of Washington as possible site for negotiations does not
                    emanate from this Government.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Phillips</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
